  {
   "id": 90190,
   "url": "https://hirakata.goguynet.jp/2026/07/12/tadaseika/",
   "date": "2026-07-12",
   "title": "【枚方市】焼きたてスイーツや限定わらびもちも！「多田製菓 直売店」で夏祭りWeek開催します！",
   "html": "<p>長尾家具町にある「<a href=\"https://www.tadaseika.co.jp/pages/news/index.html#02\">多田製菓 直売店</a>」で、2026年7月13日（月）～18日（土）まで「夏祭りWeek」が開催されます。期間中は、工場直売ならではの焼きたてシリーズが日替わりで登場予定です。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_90191\" style=\"width: 650px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-90191\" class=\"size-full wp-image-90191\" src=\"https://hirakata.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/152/2026/07/IMG_2388.jpeg\" alt=\"多田製菓\" width=\"640\" height=\"482\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-90191\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※画像はイメージです</p></div>\n<p>バナナかすてらやカステラ、たい焼き、フィナンシェなどをお得な価格で購入できます。また、社内でも人気の「白市餅のわらびもち」が数量限定で初登場し、毎日試食も実施予定です。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_90192\" style=\"width: 650px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-90192\" class=\"size-full wp-image-90192\" src=\"https://hirakata.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/152/2026/07/IMG_2389.jpeg\" alt=\"多田製菓\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-90192\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※画像はイメージです</p></div>\n<p>店内ではセールも開催されるほか、イベント内容の一部はInstagramで募集したアイデアを採用。最終日の7月18日（土）は営業時間を15時まで延長して営業します。焼きたてスイーツや限定商品を味わえるこの機会に、足を運んでみてはいかがでしょうか。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dahj7NNE4Hz/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:500px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dahj7NNE4Hz/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> </p>\n<div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"https://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><g transform=\"translate(-511.000000, -20.000000)\" fill=\"#000000\"><g><path d=\"M556.869,30.41 C554.814,30.41 553.148,32.076 553.148,34.131 C553.148,36.186 554.814,37.852 556.869,37.852 C558.924,37.852 560.59,36.186 560.59,34.131 C560.59,32.076 558.924,30.41 556.869,30.41 M541,60.657 C535.114,60.657 530.342,55.887 530.342,50 C530.342,44.114 535.114,39.342 541,39.342 C546.887,39.342 551.658,44.114 551.658,50 C551.658,55.887 546.887,60.657 541,60.657 M541,33.886 C532.1,33.886 524.886,41.1 524.886,50 C524.886,58.899 532.1,66.113 541,66.113 C549.9,66.113 557.115,58.899 557.115,50 C557.115,41.1 549.9,33.886 541,33.886 M565.378,62.101 C565.244,65.022 564.756,66.606 564.346,67.663 C563.803,69.06 563.154,70.057 562.106,71.106 C561.058,72.155 560.06,72.803 558.662,73.347 C557.607,73.757 556.021,74.244 553.102,74.378 C549.944,74.521 548.997,74.552 541,74.552 C533.003,74.552 532.056,74.521 528.898,74.378 C525.979,74.244 524.393,73.757 523.338,73.347 C521.94,72.803 520.942,72.155 519.894,71.106 C518.846,70.057 518.197,69.06 517.654,67.663 C517.244,66.606 516.755,65.022 516.623,62.101 C516.479,58.943 516.448,57.996